sequenceDiagram
    participant U as User
    participant WD as Workers Dashboard
    participant CHM as Chat Modal
    participant W as AI Worker
    participant API as Backend API
    participant TS as Tool Services
    participant TM as Task Manager

    U->>WD: View workers dashboard
    WD->>U: Display active workers
    
    Note over U, WD: User selects worker for task
    U->>WD: Click on "Email Marketing Specialist #1"
    WD->>CHM: Open chat modal
    CHM->>API: GET /api/workers/{id}/context
    API->>CHM: Return worker context & active tasks
    CHM->>U: Display chat interface
    
    Note over CHM: Chat conversation begins
    CHM->>U: Show worker greeting
    U->>CHM: Type task description
    U->>CHM: "Set up weekly newsletter campaign"
    CHM->>W: Send task request
    
    W->>TM: Create new task
    TM->>API: POST /api/tasks/create
    API->>TM: Task created with ID
    TM->>CHM: Update active tasks panel
    CHM->>U: Show task added to active tasks
    
    Note over W: Worker begins task analysis
    W->>CHM: "Starting work on newsletter campaign..."
    W->>CHM: "Let me break this down into steps"
    
    Note over W: Worker connects to tools
    W->>TS: Connect to Mailchimp API
    TS->>W: Return subscriber data
    W->>CHM: "Connecting to Mailchimp..."
    W->>CHM: Display subscriber statistics
    
    Note over W: Worker provides analysis
    W->>CHM: Show segmentation data
    W->>CHM: "Total Active Subscribers: 12,347"
    W->>CHM: Break down by segments
    
    Note over W: Task progression
    W->>TM: Update task progress (25%)
    TM->>CHM: Update progress bar
    W->>TM: Update task progress (50%)
    TM->>CHM: Update progress bar
    W->>TM: Update task progress (75%)
    TM->>CHM: Update progress bar
    
    Note over W: Task completion
    W->>TS: Configure email campaigns
    TS->>W: Campaigns configured
    W->>CHM: "Campaign setup complete!"
    W->>CHM: Display completion summary
    W->>TM: Mark task as completed
    TM->>CHM: Update task status to "Completed"
    
    Note over CHM: Offer next actions
    W->>CHM: "Want me to send a test email?"
    CHM->>U: Show action suggestions
    
    U->>CHM: Click "Save & Continue Later"
    CHM->>API: Save conversation state
    CHM->>WD: Return to dashboard
    WD->>U: Show updated worker metrics 